# HEIC security update.
codec.heif.msg.unsafe_version = Go gana go dirisa libheif {version} ka ntlha ya makowa a a itsiweng a tshireletsego; go tlhokega mofuta wa {minimum} kgotsa o mosha go feta oo. Laeletsa tshegetso ya HEIC e e ntšhafaditsweng kgotsa o ntšhafatse laeborari ya tsamaiso.
codec.heif.msg.unknown_version = Go gana go dirisa libheif ka gonne mofuta wa yone o ka se netefadiwe; go tlhokega mofuta wa {minimum} kgotsa o mosha go feta oo. Laeletsa tshegetso ya HEIC e e ntšhafaditsweng kgotsa o ntšhafatse laeborari ya tsamaiso.
dialog.open.heic_needs_safe_decoder = Go bula “{name}” go tlhoka libheif {minimum} kgotsa mofuta o mosha go feta oo, le decoder ya HEVC. Mefuta ya bogologolo kgotsa e e ka se netefadiweng e thibetswe go sireletsa kgatlhanong le makowa a a itsiweng a tshireletsego. Laeletsa tshegetso ya HEIC e e ntšhafaditsweng gore o tswelele.
workspace.docs.heic_safe_decoder_needed = Go tlhokega tshegetso ya HEIC e e ntšhafaditsweng
